# Green Wave needs NO API keys, tokens, or accounts to run. Route Drive
# (destination search + routing) uses the public, open-source, key-free
# OSRM and Nominatim demo servers by default.
#
# These are shared community resources meant for light/personal use, not
# high-volume production traffic. If you self-host your own instance,
# point these at it (optional — safe to leave unset):

# OSRM_BASE_URL=https://your-osrm-instance.example.com
# NOMINATIM_BASE_URL=https://your-nominatim-instance.example.com
# OVERPASS_BASE_URL=https://your-overpass-instance.example.com/api/interpreter
